  "id": "extreme-capsule",
  "term": "extreme capsule",
  "definition": "The extreme capsule is a white matter tract discussed as one of the major pathways thought to contribute to language processing. It is part of the brain’s network of connections linking cortical language-related areas, although its specific function is not yet fully understood.",
